[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0009","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0161","title":"Cisco Catalyst交换机 IOS SNMP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 交换机上运行的 Cisco IOS 软件简单网络管理协议（SNMP）子系统中存在拒绝服务漏洞。当受影响软件处理包含 ciscoFlashMIB 对象标识符（OID）请求的 SNMP 读取请求时，会触发 CPU 资源耗尽条件（SYS-3-CPUHOG），导致设备重启。已通过 SNMPv2 或 SNMPv3 认证的远程攻击者可向目标设备发送特制的 SNMP GET 请求触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响运行特定版本 Cisco IOS 并配置 SNMPv2/v3 的 Catalyst 2960-L 系列、Digital Building 系列 8P/8U 交换机，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。Cisco 已发布安全公告 CSCvd89541 修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0161"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:58Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 15.2(5)E2 或更新版本（通过 Cisco IOS Software Checker 确认具体修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可配置 SNMP ACL 限制仅允许可信源 IP 访问：`access-list 1 permit 192.168.0.1` 和 `snmp-server community example RO 1`；或将 ciscoFlashMIB 从 SNMP 查询列表中排除：`snmp-server view example ciscoFlashMIB excluded` 配合 `snmp-server community example view example ro`。同时建议启用 Unicast RPF 防止 UDP 源地址欺骗。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103573","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040589","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-snmp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0161","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0161.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0161.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0161.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0161.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0161","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0161.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0161.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0161.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0161.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2018/CVE-2018-0161.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0008","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0159","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE IKEv1 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 与 Cisco IOS XE 软件在实现 Internet Key Exchange Version 1（IKEv1）功能时存在输入验证漏洞。该漏洞源于对特定 IKEv1 数据包的验证不足，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在 IKE 协商阶段向受影响设备发送特制 IKEv1 数据包，触发设备重新加载，导致拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞影响运行受影响 Cisco IOS 及 IOS XE 软件版本的路由器、交换机等网络设备，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。Cisco 已在后续安全更新中修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0159"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:58Z","remediation":"Cisco 已发布修复此漏洞的软件更新，建议立即通过 Cisco IOS Software Checker（https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/softwarechecker.x）查询当前运行版本对应的首个修复版本，然后升级至安全的 Cisco IOS 或 IOS XE 发行版；在设备 CLI 中使用 show version 确认当前版本，使用 show ip sockets 或 show udp 检查 ISAKMP 是否启用，升级前确保设备内存充足且硬件配置受新版本支持；如无 Cisco 服务合同，请联系 Cisco TAC（https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tsd-cisco-worldwide-contacts.html）获取免费升级授权并提供设备序列号及本公告链接作为凭证；此漏洞无临时缓解措施，须通过升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103562","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040595","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-ike-dos","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0159","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0159.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0159.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0159.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0159.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0159","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0159.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0159.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0159.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0159.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0159.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0007","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0158","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE IKEv2 输入验证漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 及 IOS XE 软件的 Internet 密钥交换版本 2（IKEv2）模块存在输入验证漏洞。该漏洞源于对特定 IKEv2 数据包的处理不正确，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 IKEv2 数据包触发漏洞，导致设备持续消耗内存并最终重新加载，造成拒绝服务（DoS）条件。攻击无需用户交互或权限，攻击复杂度低，影响范围广。Cisco 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0158"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:57Z","remediation":"立即登录 Cisco.com 并使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker 工具（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/selectIOSVersion.x）查询当前运行版本对应的修复版本，升级至 March 2018 安全公告捆绑包中指定的第一修复版本。该漏洞无任何变通方案，必须通过软件升级修复。CISA KEV 已确认该漏洞在野被积极利用，建议在 2022 年 3 月 17 日前完成升级。升级后重启设备使新版本生效，并在防火墙层面限制对 UDP 500/4500 端口的非授权访问作为深度防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103566","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040595","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-03","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-ike","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0158","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0158.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e416a76e395c31381fb5ba3eaf056e80b234a82c/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0158.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0158.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0158","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0158.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0158.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0158.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-0158/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0158.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0158.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0006","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0156","title":"Cisco IOS/IOS XE Smart Install 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的 Smart Install 功能存在输入验证不当漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备的 TCP 端口 4786 发送特制数据包，触发设备重载，导致拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞仅影响配置为 Smart Install 客户端的交换机，Smart Install 导演设备不受影响。Cisco 已在安全公告中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0156"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:57Z","remediation":"立即升级受影响的 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 设备至 Cisco 安全公告 cisco-sa-20180328-smi 中指定的修复版本，可通过 Cisco IOS Software Checker 查询具体修复版本号。如无法立即升级且不需要 Smart Install 功能，可在全局配置模式下执行 `no vstack` 命令禁用该功能作为临时缓解措施。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，需优先处置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103569","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040596","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-04","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-smi","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0156","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0156.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0156.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0156.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0156.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0156","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0156.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0156.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0156.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0156.md","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2018-0156.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0005","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0155","title":"Cisco Catalyst 4500/Catalyst 4500-X 双向转发检测卸载实现拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 4500 系列和 Catalyst 4500-X 系列交换机的双向转发检测（BFD）卸载实现存在安全漏洞。该漏洞源于对不完整 BFD 报文的错误处理不足，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响交换机发送特制的 BFD 消息，触发 iosd 进程崩溃，导致拒绝服务（DoS）条件。成功利用该漏洞可导致系统重载。受影响设备包括 Catalyst 4500 Supervisor Engine 6-E/6L-E/7-E/7L-E/8-E/8L-E/9-E 系列引擎、Catalyst 4500-X 系列交换机、Catalyst 4900M 及 Catalyst 4948E 以太网交换机。CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0155"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:57Z","remediation":"升级至 Cisco 官方修复版本：Catalyst 4500 系列升级至 IOS 15.2(1)E 或更高版本，Catalyst 4500-X 系列升级至 IOS XE 3.5.0E 或更高版本。如不使用 BFD 功能，可在全局配置模式下执行 `feature bfd disable` 命令禁用 BFD 以消除风险；如必须使用 BFD，可通过 Control Plane Policing (CoPP) 仅允许已知 BFD 对等体的报文，丢弃其他 BFD 流量作为临时缓解措施。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），需在 2022 年 3 月 17 日前完成修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103565","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040587","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-05","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-bfd","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0155","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0155.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0155.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0155.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0155","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0155.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0155.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0155.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0155.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0155.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-0155/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0004","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0154","title":"Cisco IOS ISM-VPN Crypto Engine 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 软件中集成服务模块 VPN（ISM-VPN）的加密引擎存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于设备对 VPN 流量处理不足，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 VPN 数据包触发漏洞，导致设备挂起或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 软件的 ISM-VPN 模块，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0154"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:57Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至修复版本。使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/software-checker）输入当前 IOS 版本号，获取对应修复版本并升级。该漏洞无变通方案，必须通过软件升级修复。Cisco 已确认该漏洞在野外被积极利用，建议立即安排维护窗口完成升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103559","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040585","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-dos","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0154","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0154.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0154.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0154.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0154.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0154","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0154.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-0154.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0154.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-0154.md","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2018-0154.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0003","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0151","title":"Cisco IOS 及 IOS XE 软件 QoS 子系统缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 软件和 IOS XE 软件的 QoS（服务质量）子系统存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于对发往受影响设备 UDP 端口 18999 的特定数据包中某些值的边界检查不正确，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的恶意数据包触发缓冲区溢出，导致设备重载造成拒绝服务，或利用提升的权限在设备上执行任意代码。成功利用该漏洞可完全控制受影响设备。仅需目标设备处理该恶意数据包即可触发，穿越设备的流量不会触发此漏洞。Cisco 已发布安全更新修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0151"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:56Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Cisco IOS/IOS XE 的修复版本，使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker 工具（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/selectIOSVersion.x）查询具体受影响版本对应的修复版本号。如无法立即升级，可在设备上配置 Control Plane Policing（CoPP）策略，通过 ACL 拒绝所有发往 UDP 18999 端口的入站流量作为临时缓解措施。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），需在 2022 年 3 月 17 日前完成修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103540","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040582","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-18-107-03","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180328-qos","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0151","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0151.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0151.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0151.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-0151.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0151.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0151","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0151.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0151.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0151.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0217","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8823","title":"PrestaShop Responsive Mega Menu Pro 模块远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PrestaShop 的 Responsive Mega Menu Pro 模块 1.0.32 及更早版本中，`modules/bamegamenu/ajax_phpcode.php` 文件存在代码注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该文件发送特制的 `code` 参数，直接注入并执行任意 PHP 代码，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 PrestaShop 1.5.5.0 至 1.7.2.5 版本，攻击无需用户交互，利用复杂度低，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8823"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-28T02:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:05:27Z","remediation":"从 PrestaShop Addons Marketplace 升级 Responsive Mega Menu (Horizontal+Vertical+Dropdown) Pro 模块至最新版本。如暂时无法升级，应立即删除 modules/bamegamenu/ajax_phpcode.php 文件或在整个 PrestaShop 站点的 php.ini 中禁用 exec()、passthru()、shell_exec()、system() 等危险 PHP 函数作为临时缓解，随后替换为其他安全菜单模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://ia-informatica.com/it/CVE-2018-8823","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8823.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-8823.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2018/CVE-2018-8823.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8823.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8823.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8823.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-8823.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/responsive_mega_menu_pro_project/responsive_mega_menu_pro/CVE-2018-8823.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8823.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-8823.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2018-8823.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0203","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7700","title":"DeDeCMS 5.7 跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"DedeCMS 5.7 后台存在跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞，位于 tag_test_action.php 文件中。攻击者可利用 partcode 参数构造恶意请求，结合 runphp 字段实现任意 PHP 代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，但需要管理员登录状态下访问攻击者构造的恶意链接。成功利用后攻击者可完全控制目标网站，包括获取敏感数据、篡改页面内容或植入后门。影响 DedeCMS 5.7 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7700"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-27T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:33Z","remediation":"升级 DedeCMS 至官方发布的最新版本（5.7 SP2 或更高），该版本已修复 tag_test_action.php 中 runphp 参数导致的 CSRF 任意代码执行漏洞。如无法升级，在 include/taglib/tag_test_action.php 中移除对 runphp 参数的处理逻辑，并在后台管理路径上增加 CSRF Token 校验机制，同时限制管理后台仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://laworigin.github.io/2018/03/07/CVE-2018-7700-dedecms%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7700.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7700.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2018/CVE-2018-7700.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7700.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-7700.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7700-3621.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7700-3620.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7700-3618.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7700-3622.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/dedecms-cve-2018-7700-rce.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7700.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0203.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0192","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0192.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7196","title":"Enhancesoft osTicket 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Enhancesoft osTicket 1.10.2 之前版本的 /scp/index.php 页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。由于对 \"sort\" 参数缺乏充分的过滤与转义处理，远程攻击者可构造恶意 URL 诱使已登录的管理员用户点击，导致任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 在用户浏览器中执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可发起攻击，但需要用户交互配合。成功利用可窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或发起钓鱼攻击，影响系统机密性与完整性。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7196"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-27T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:20:35Z","remediation":"升级 osTicket 至 1.10.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 /scp/index.php 中 sort 参数的 XSS 问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则过滤 sort 参数中的 <script>、onerror 等恶意 HTML/JS 关键字，并对用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.securityevaluators.com/vulnerabilities-found-in-popular-ticketing-system-dd273bda229c","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/h