hp 中 order 参数的 XSS 问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面添加规则对 order 参数进行 HTML 编码过滤，或限制对 /scp/directory.php 的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.securityevaluators.com/vulnerabilities-found-in-popular-ticketing-system-dd273bda229c","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7193.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7193.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7193.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7193.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/osticket/osticket/CVE-2018-7193.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-7193.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-7193.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7193.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-7193.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-7193.yaml","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/4cf955fbecaa77ac44d4ef96873cffa045427058/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7193.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0191.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0190","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0190.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7192","title":"Enhancesoft osTicket 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Enhancesoft osTicket 1.10.1 及之前版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 /ajax.php/form/help-topic 页面的 \"message\" 参数。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向该参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问被攻击的页面时，注入的脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。攻击条件低，仅需诱导用户点击恶意链接即可触发。该漏洞影响 osTicket 1.10.2 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7192"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-27T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:20:35Z","remediation":"升级 osTicket 至 1.10.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 /ajax.php/form/help-topic 接口中 message 参数的 XSS 过滤问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 message 参数中的 `<script>`、`onerror` 等 HTML 标签和事件处理器进行过滤拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.securityevaluators.com/vulnerabilities-found-in-popular-ticketing-system-dd273bda229c","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7192.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7192.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7192.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7192.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/osticket/osticket/CVE-2018-7192.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-7192.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-7192.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7192.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-7192.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-7192_1.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-7192.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0190.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0906","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6882","title":"Synacor Zimbra Collaboration 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Synacor Zimbra Collaboration Suite（ZCS）的 ZmMailMsgView.getAttachmentLinkHtml 函数存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理邮件附件的 Content-Location HTTP 头时未正确过滤特殊字符，导致攻击者可在邮件附件中注入恶意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码。当用户查看包含恶意附件的邮件时，注入的脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，造成敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击者只需向目标用户发送特制邮件即可触发，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（查看邮件）。该漏洞影响 ZCS 8.7 Patch 1 之前版本及 8.8.x 系列中 8.8.7 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6882"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-27T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:02:24Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Zimbra Collaboration 8.7.11 Patch 1 或 8.8.7 及以上版本。升级前可在邮件网关层过滤包含异常 Content-Location 头的邮件附件作为临时缓解措施，同时建议限制用户预览 HTML 格式邮件以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Mar/52","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/541891/100/0/threaded","https://bugzilla.zimbra.com/show_bug.cgi?id=108786","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Releases/8.8.7","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Security_Advisories","https://www.securify.nl/advisory/SFY20180101/cross-site-scripting-vulnerability-in-zimbra-collaboration-suite-due-to-the-way-it-handles-attachment-links.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-6882","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6882.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6882.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6882.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6882.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6882.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-6882.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-6882.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-6882.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-6882.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6882.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-6882.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0204","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0204.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7719","title":"Acrolinx Server for Windows 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Acrolinx Server for Windows 5.2.5 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径遍历技术突破目录限制，读取服务器文件系统中的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、密码文件等）。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需网络可达即可利用，影响运行 Acrolinx Server 5.2.5 以下版本的 Windows 系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7719"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-25T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:35Z","remediation":"升级 Acrolinx Server 至 5.2.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复路径遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 `../` 等目录遍历特征的请求路径，并限制应用程序对文件系统的访问权限。同时建议将 Acrolinx Server 部署在内网，避免暴露在公网环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.acrolinx.com/hc/en-us/articles/213987685-Acrolinx-Server-Version-5-1-including-subsequent-service-releases-","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44345/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44345","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7719.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7719.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2018/CVE-2018-7719.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7719.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-7719.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7719-3625.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7719-3626.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7719-3624.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-7719.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-7719/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-7719.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Acrolinx Server/CVE-2018-7719.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0204.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0064","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1207","title":"Dell EMC iDRAC7和iDRAC8 CGI注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Dell EMC iDRAC7和iDRAC8在2.52.52.52之前的版本中存在CGI注入漏洞（CWE-94，代码注入）。该漏洞源于程序在处理CGI变量时未对输入进行充分的过滤与校验，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器管理接口发送特制的HTTP请求，在CGI变量中注入恶意代码并使其执行，从而实现远程代码执行。攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用该漏洞，影响范围覆盖iDRAC7和iDRAC8系列固件；一旦利用成功，攻击者可完全控制受影响主机，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1207"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-23T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:42Z","remediation":"立即将 Dell EMC iDRAC7/iDRAC8 固件升级至 2.52.52.52 或更高版本，此版本修复了 /cgi-bin/login、/cgi-bin/putfile 等 CGI 接口的参数注入问题。若暂时无法升级，应通过防火墙将 iDRAC 管理端口（TCP 443/80）限制为仅可信管理网段访问，禁止暴露到互联网，并关闭不必要的 CGI 接口。同时修改默认管理员口令、启用会话超时与访问日志监控，以便及时发现异常登录与文件上传行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://en.community.dell.com/techcenter/extras/m/white_papers/20485410","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103694","https://twitter.com/nicowaisman/status/977279766792466432","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52246","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1207.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2018/CVE-2018-1207.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5eee2445284809f10c9bff1b33b94a17c67c3758/2018/CVE-2018-1207.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/78706b5baefa79357f83155454b1df360a4a3b71/2018/CVE-2018-1207.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1207.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-1207.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1207-3227.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1207-3230.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1207-3229.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Dell EMC/CVE-2018-1207.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-1207.yaml","https://github.com/mgargiullo/cve-2018-1207","https://github.com/hironull/CVE-2018-1207-better"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0064.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0064.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0064.toml"}]